@rule duo3.open.b.any.teasing
on duo3.open.b
when tone=teasing
- [We were just talking about you.|Speak of the devil.|Don't keep us waiting~]

# ================= the two of them talking (after a turn, or in a silence) =================
@rule duo3.banter.a.argue.gentle
on duo3.banter.a
when argue=yes tone=gentle
feel pout
- [About {topic}... I still think I'm right.|We never settled {topic}, you know.|Can we talk about {topic} again? Because you're wrong.]

@rule duo3.banter.a.argue.energetic
on duo3.banter.a
when argue=yes tone=energetic
feel pout
- [Okay but {topic}! I'm SO right about this!|I'm not letting {topic} go!|Admit it, I won on {topic}!]

@rule duo3.banter.a.argue.cool
on duo3.banter.a
when argue=yes tone=cool
feel pout
- [About {topic}. I was right.|{Topic}. Let's finish this.|We still haven't settled {topic}.]

@rule duo3.banter.a.argue.teasing
on duo3.banter.a
when argue=yes tone=teasing
feel pout
- [About {topic}. I was right.|{Topic}. Let's finish this.|We still haven't settled {topic}.]

@rule duo3.banter.b.argue.gentle
on duo3.banter.b
when argue=yes tone=gentle
feel pout
- [...No, you're not.|I don't think so...|Let's just ask him.]

@rule duo3.banter.b.argue.energetic
on duo3.banter.b
when argue=yes tone=energetic
feel pout
- [No way! You're totally wrong!|Ugh, not this again!|Fine! He decides!]

@rule duo3.banter.b.argue.cool
on duo3.banter.b
when argue=yes tone=cool
feel pout
- [...No.|You're wrong and you know it.|Let him decide, then.]

@rule duo3.banter.b.argue.teasing
on duo3.banter.b
when argue=yes tone=teasing
feel pout
- [...No.|You're wrong and you know it.|Let him decide, then.]

